otoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MillerK","Id":279306,"Name":"MillerK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":388,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b66ab603c78129d4960cf5c1b0f9920","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I totally get why Mexico is a popular location. It&#039;s Americanized enough that the food is very consistent, nice turquoise water and white sand beaches and the culture is great. I love Mexico.. My wedding will be my fifth time going back to Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886315,"PostDate":1423845578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I totally get why Mexico is a popular location. It's Americanized enough that the food is very consistent, nice turquoise water and white sand beaches and the culture is great. I love Mexico.. My wedding will be my fifth time going back to Mexico.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>