Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.191.35.221","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"139a0d19207f5e0fb4c2f4b31ce1b74e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Love this website! So I just recently got engaged and want to do a destination wedding, I have narrowed it down to 2 resorts in Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) The Finest in Playa Mujeres&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) The Beach Palace in Cancun&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am looking for a resort that has top shelf alcohol, beautiful beach with no sticks and shells hurting your feet, and beautiful weather. What is the best month to get married? Would love to hear your feedback ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901901,"PostDate":1438787420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love this website! So I just recently got engaged and want to do a destination wedding, I have narrowed it down to 2 resorts in Mexico.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) The Finest in Playa Mujeres<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2) The Beach Palace in Cancun<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for a resort that has top shelf alcohol, beautiful beach with no sticks and shells hurting your feet, and beautiful weather. What is the best month to get married? Would love to hear your feedback <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanie.varias@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.191.35.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438706552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"stephanienicole","Id":284272,"Name":"stephanienicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16886cd66d5c9266cd6b403cf122a238","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! Mexico is beautiful for a DW! I would definitely recommend finding a good travel agent first of all. Both the resorts you mentioned have their own specific features and are both very popular resorts with the brides to be here. Beach Palace is very popular. I know there are a couple of threads here of brides that have used or are using Beach Palace. Just do a search up top and there will be different forums that come up. Reading definitely will get you ideas that have been used by past brides as well as what current brides are going through with their planning. A travel agent will help you with your must haves, your budget and the budget for your guests as well as what the packages offer and what they cost. You might also be entitled to some perks or something that are available that a travel agent will be able to help you with.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t know if you&#039;re in the US or Canada but there are agent recommendations here that might also help you out.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901922,"PostDate":1438795229,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! Mexico is beautiful for a DW! I would definitely recommend finding a good travel agent first of all. Both the resorts you mentioned have their own specific features and are both very popular resorts with the brides to be here. Beach Palace is very popular. I know there are a couple of threads here of brides that have used or are using Beach Palace. Just do a search up top and there will be different forums that come up. Reading definitely will get you ideas that have been used by past brides as well as what current brides are going through with their planning. A travel agent will help you with your must haves, your budget and the budget for your guests as well as what the packages offer and what they cost. You might also be entitled to some perks or something that are available that a travel agent will be able to help you with.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I don't know if you're in the US or Canada but there are agent recommendations here that might also help you out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f98a5e70ae514c414c714c8638155d89","RawContent":"[quote name=\"stephanienicole\" post=\"1901901\" timestamp=\"1438787420\"]\nHello all,\n\nLove this website! So I just recently got engaged and want to do a destination wedding, I have narrowed it down to 2 resorts in Mexico.\n\n1) The Finest in Playa Mujeres\n\n2) The Beach Palace in Cancun\n\nI am looking for a resort that has top shelf alcohol, beautiful beach with no sticks and shells hurting your feet, and beautiful weather. What is the best month to get married? Would love to hear your feedback ;)[\/quote]Hey @[member=\"stephanienicole\"],\n\nI have done weddings at both resort.   \n1.  Finest playa mujeres has such a beautiful beach in fact the ceremony is really not crowded by tourist on the beach.  if you go with them choose their sky terrace its absolutely beautiful.  Services was a little slow but nothing major.\n\n\n2.  Beach palace the food is amazing !  service was good ,also with them go with their roof top on 8th floor . it has a perfect view to the ocean. because the beach is in the hotel zone so its a bit busy there.  for what ever reason I cannot post pics in this post. \n\n\n\nFeel free to reach out I can share pics with you.\n\nHappy Planning\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1901948,"PostDate":1438817034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>stephanienicole, on 05 August 2015 - 07:10 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love this website! So I just recently got engaged and want to do a destination wedding, I have narrowed it down to 2 resorts in Mexico.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) The Finest in Playa Mujeres<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2) The Beach Palace in Cancun<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for a resort that has top shelf alcohol, beautiful beach with no sticks and shells hurting your feet, and beautiful weather. What is the best month to get married? Would love to hear your feedback <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284272\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284272-stephanienicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephanienicole<\/span><\/a>,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have done weddings at both resort. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. \u00a0Finest playa mujeres has such a beautiful beach in fact the ceremony is really not crowded by tourist on the beach. \u00a0if you go with them choose their sky terrace its absolutely beautiful. \u00a0Services was a little slow but nothing major.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. \u00a0Beach palace the food is amazing ! \u00a0service was good ,also with them go with their roof top on 8th floor . it has a perfect view to the ocean. because the beach is in the hotel zone so its a bit busy there. \u00a0for what ever reason I cannot post pics in this post.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel free to reach out I can share pics with you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1438883851,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ccae37df17223e4aae5f85b86f63da20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming dw, Stephanie!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a link to our webpage with info on Mexican weather to help you decide which time you prefer for your wedding: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/ww.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!weather-sunset\/cggz&#039;&gt;Mexican Weather link&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration for your beach wedding plans, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera - enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11845102_10153513729759487_3729843888491343933_o.jpg\" alt=\"11845102_10153513729759487_3729843888491\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011138904_o.jpg\" alt=\"11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268284102_o.jpg\" alt=\"10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902020,"PostDate":1438883810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming dw, Stephanie!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a link to our webpage with info on Mexican weather to help you decide which time you prefer for your wedding: <a href='http:\/\/ww.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!weather-sunset\/cggz' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Mexican Weather link<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration for your beach wedding plans, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" we captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera - enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11845102_10153513729759487_3729843888491343933_o.jpg\" alt=\"11845102_10153513729759487_3729843888491\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011138904_o.jpg\" alt=\"11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268284102_o.jpg\" alt=\"10535707_10152664882419487_1728880669268\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.191.35.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"042ebff65e2f1e6b8d34cc813fcc1fce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I know for sure it DW will be Mexico. Just need help deciding what is the best month. Looking for something after July 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902076,"PostDate":1438956948,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know for sure it DW will be Mexico. Just need help deciding what is the best month. Looking for something after July 2016.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanie.varias@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.191.35.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438706552,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"stephanienicole","Id":284272,"Name":"stephanienicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.110.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39be751bd7f811139e86d3b5604aae3d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Stephanie,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrations and welcome on board!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I faced the same challenge. The ladies on this site are VERY informative. It definitely helped in my decision and I will still be doing a site visit later this year. The best advice I could give to decide between the 2 resorts is to write a pros and cons list for each one based on your preferences and what is most important to you. From there you will definitely know the way to go!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902113,"PostDate":1438977606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Stephanie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrations and welcome on board!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I faced the same challenge. The ladies on this site are VERY informative. It definitely helped in my decision and I will still be doing a site visit later this year. The best advice I could give to decide between the 2 resorts is to write a pros and cons list for each one based on your preferences and what is most important to you. From there you will definitely know the way to go!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clerveaux16@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.149.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432149818,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mlklovestory716","Id":283178,"Name":"mlklovestory716","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.45.59.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bdf74d63e660cb3b7de0418ef4cd419","RawContent":"Hi Stephanie,\n\n\nMy fianc\u00e9 and I researched for the last year or so and have finally booked excellence playa mujeres. We&#039;ve been to tons of sandals, secrets etc and decided to try something different. They ticked all our boxes, have great pricing, have had great communication and the resort looks beyond gorgeous. It all depends on what you want, we find cancun to be a bit too noisy so us personally wouldn&#039;t do it there. We&#039;ve stayed at multiple resorts in the riviera so I wouldn&#039;t discount those but check out EPM, happy hunting!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1902188,"PostDate":1439156771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Stephanie,<br><br>\nMy fianc\u00e9 and I researched for the last year or so and have finally booked excellence playa mujeres. We've been to tons of sandals, secrets etc and decided to try something different. They ticked all our boxes, have great pricing, have had great communication and the resort looks beyond gorgeous. It all depends on what you want, we find cancun to be a bit too noisy so us personally wouldn't do it there. We've stayed at multiple resorts in the riviera so I wouldn't discount those but check out EPM, happy hunting!!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen__jacobsen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"206.45.59.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439156230,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Beachybride2016","Id":284340,"Name":"Beachybride2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
