Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.250.235.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4caa68ef23e5b9f17d4de3a1f6ec004","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve never been but from what I have read while researching, it is not the turquoise blue water you would see on the Cancun hotel zone. The water is more greenish blue in Playa Mujeres but does seem to be much more calm than the hotel zone. Sometimes there can be seagrass but assuming the resort does a good job raking and cleaning, it shouldn&#039;t be a problem. Can&#039;t control mother nature so no worries. To get a better idea of the beach conditions, check out photos on Tripadvisor for Excellence Playa Mujeres or The Beloved Hotel. They are on the same strip of beach.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so glad to hear I&#039;m not the only one who chose a resort that is not open yet. My date is April 19, 2015. The wedding coordinator, Claudia Cantillo, has been pleasant to work with so far. She used to be the WC at Dreams Cancun. &amp;lt;-discovered that on this forum. Happy planning Megwade!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858386,"PostDate":1404697400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've never been but from what I have read while researching, it is not the turquoise blue water you would see on the Cancun hotel zone. The water is more greenish blue in Playa Mujeres but does seem to be much more calm than the hotel zone. Sometimes there can be seagrass but assuming the resort does a good job raking and cleaning, it shouldn't be a problem. Can't control mother nature so no worries. To get a better idea of the beach conditions, check out photos on Tripadvisor for Excellence Playa Mujeres or The Beloved Hotel. They are on the same strip of beach.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so glad to hear I'm not the only one who chose a resort that is not open yet. My date is April 19, 2015. The wedding coordinator, Claudia Cantillo, has been pleasant to work with so far. She used to be the WC at Dreams Cancun. <-discovered that on this forum. Happy planning Megwade!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sugagingin@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.250.235.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403837151,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ginnyc","Id":278720,"Name":"ginnyc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.95","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6c0f4e61c3df18d553fe1b31d2e7deb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Meg - Congratulations! You have great taste in resorts... how do I know? I booked the same Secrets Playa Mujeres property and we are getting married the same week as you. Heading there May 3 - 10, 2015 and our wedding is on May 7th. What day is your wedding? The resort looks gorgeous and my travel agent had nothing but great things to say about it and Secrets in general. PM is a very exclusive area and should be more private then a resort right in Cancun. Best of luck with the planning - we should keep in touch to compare notes as we go through the process! Who knows maybe I&#039;ll see you there! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1859931,"PostDate":1405472007,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Meg - Congratulations! You have great taste in resorts... how do I know? I booked the same Secrets Playa Mujeres property and we are getting married the same week as you. Heading there May 3 - 10, 2015 and our wedding is on May 7th. What day is your wedding? The resort looks gorgeous and my travel agent had nothing but great things to say about it and Secrets in general. PM is a very exclusive area and should be more private then a resort right in Cancun. Best of luck with the planning - we should keep in touch to compare notes as we go through the process! Who knows maybe I'll see you there! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lorallandriault@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.95","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397444313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277581.jpg?_r=1405552495","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsAllison","Id":277581,"Name":"FutureMrsAllison","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.231.156.214","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"801441becbc7d963662d694a3d9976b7","RawContent":"Congrats","Attachments":[],"Id":1859952,"PostDate":1405475976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noeljennifer1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"12.52.150.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403618319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278674.jpg?_r=1405114043","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifernoel1","Id":278674,"Name":"jennifernoel1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db502a6edf7eb7099f6402583503107c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsAllison\" post=\"1859931\" timestamp=\"1405472007\"]\nHey Meg - Congratulations! You have great taste in resorts... how do I know? I booked the same Secrets Playa Mujeres property and we are getting married the same week as you. Heading there May 3 - 10, 2015 and our wedding is on May 7th. What day is your wedding? The resort looks gorgeous and my travel agent had nothing but great things to say about it and Secrets in general. PM is a very exclusive area and should be more private then a resort right in Cancun. Best of luck with the planning - we should keep in touch to compare notes as we go through the process! Who knows maybe I&#039;ll see you there! :)[\/quote]\n\nHEY!! OMG this is exciting! We are travelling the exact same time.  Where are you travelling from? We should definately keep in touch and help each other with planning\/ideas!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1860014,"PostDate":1405481489,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsAllison, on 15 July 2014 - 04:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey Meg - Congratulations! You have great taste in resorts... how do I know? I booked the same Secrets Playa Mujeres property and we are getting married the same week as you. Heading there May 3 - 10, 2015 and our wedding is on May 7th. What day is your wedding? The resort looks gorgeous and my travel agent had nothing but great things to say about it and Secrets in general. PM is a very exclusive area and should be more private then a resort right in Cancun. Best of luck with the planning - we should keep in touch to compare notes as we go through the process! Who knows maybe I'll see you there! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>HEY!! OMG this is exciting! We are travelling the exact same time.\u00a0 Where are you travelling from? We should definately keep in touch and help each other with planning\/ideas!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megwade@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401238846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278140.jpg?_r=1401242002","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megwade","Id":278140,"Name":"megwade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be8ec3824c23262bb2f0337f35697ef4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow it looks like another gorgeous Secrets property!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860133,"PostDate":1405527754,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow it looks like another gorgeous Secrets property!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.253.31.12","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea524947cf8ab3fd48723246bff788a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi girls.&amp;nbsp; I am just about to book May 3rd for my wedding at Secrets Playa Mujeres!&amp;nbsp; Scared to book a resort that I can&#039;t read reviews about but it is Secrets so it has to be nice, right?&amp;nbsp; Feeling a little worried about what people are writing about the beach...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Nicki&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873532,"PostDate":1411829791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi girls.\u00a0 I am just about to book May 3rd for my wedding at Secrets Playa Mujeres!\u00a0 Scared to book a resort that I can't read reviews about but it is Secrets so it has to be nice, right?\u00a0 Feeling a little worried about what people are writing about the beach...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Nicki<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicoledschaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.253.31.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411828502,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nschaffer","Id":280054,"Name":"nschaffer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.49.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a8b61e8309657c67aee5cf05cd8a3f8","RawContent":"Definitely do it!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1873541,"PostDate":1411832850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Definitely do it!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megwade@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401238846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278140.jpg?_r=1401242002","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megwade","Id":278140,"Name":"megwade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.5.56.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d742413dc99ec4fb88455563f21c568","RawContent":"Congrats! All I know is the property is beside the excellence playa mujeres so lok at their beach photos to get an idea of the seaweed situation. Everyone there cleans the beach I&#039;ve heard so shouldn&#039;t really be an issue. We love secrets resorts!","Attachments":[],"Id":1873558,"PostDate":1411853536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats! All I know is the property is beside the excellence playa mujeres so lok at their beach photos to get an idea of the seaweed situation. Everyone there cleans the beach I've heard so shouldn't really be an issue. We love secrets resorts!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407351354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"8.10.80.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a259eb530ffe8791f3c6528210c844b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats ladies! I booked at a new Dreams property and it&#039;s not opening until Nov 2014 as well. &amp;nbsp;So I&#039;m in the same boat as &amp;nbsp;you with not having any idea how the wedding will be since it&#039;s not opened yet. But I&#039;m sure everything will work out and be beautiful.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873718,"PostDate":1412018651,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats ladies! I booked at a new Dreams property and it's not opening until Nov 2014 as well. \u00a0So I'm in the same boat as \u00a0you with not having any idea how the wedding will be since it's not opened yet. But I'm sure everything will work out and be beautiful.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.243.231.96","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e564728d9dab62273bbdc12379390c46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"rvalenka\"] I am also getting married at Secrets Maroma next September! I would love love love details when you get back!! I dont know anyone else who has gotten married there and I am dying for information. It would be so helpful if you could keep in touch with your details and pictures&amp;nbsp; Thanks!! Enjoy and have a great time!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873723,"PostDate":1412019342,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274900\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/274900-rvalenka\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rvalenka<\/span><\/a> I am also getting married at Secrets Maroma next September! I would love love love details when you get back!! I dont know anyone else who has gotten married there and I am dying for information. It would be so helpful if you could keep in touch with your details and pictures\u00a0 Thanks!! Enjoy and have a great time!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leigh.tillotson@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.201.65.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410886036,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"latillo7","Id":279860,"Name":"latillo7","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":29,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
