{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97b7b8231cba0da2edabb9e6777d259b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"latillo7\" post=\"1873723\" timestamp=\"1412019342\"]\n@[member=\"rvalenka\"] I am also getting married at Secrets Maroma next September! I would love love love details when you get back!! I dont know anyone else who has gotten married there and I am dying for information. It would be so helpful if you could keep in touch with your details and pictures  Thanks!! Enjoy and have a great time!![\/quote]I&#039;m planning a wedding for July 2015 at Secrets Maroma.  I&#039;m super excited but would love to know more details as well!","Attachments":[],"Id":1879546,"PostDate":1417619661,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>latillo7, on 29 September 2014 - 11:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274900\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/274900-rvalenka\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">rvalenka<\/span><\/a> I am also getting married at Secrets Maroma next September! I would love love love details when you get back!! I dont know anyone else who has gotten married there and I am dying for information. It would be so helpful if you could keep in touch with your details and pictures\u00a0 Thanks!! Enjoy and have a great time!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I'm planning a wedding for July 2015 at Secrets Maroma.\u00a0 I'm super excited but would love to know more details as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415121095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.96.47.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf8777429ba4fafc1bc5411aed4e6063","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am so glad Secrets Playa Mujeres Brides are writing! I get married there Nov. 16 2015! I cant wait to hear more about your journey through planning! &amp;nbsp;I have not talked to the wedding coordinator yet, we just signed the contract through our travel agent. Have you seen any wedding pictures yet?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880324,"PostDate":1418580451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am so glad Secrets Playa Mujeres Brides are writing! I get married there Nov. 16 2015! I cant wait to hear more about your journey through planning! \u00a0I have not talked to the wedding coordinator yet, we just signed the contract through our travel agent. Have you seen any wedding pictures yet?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tarah.kreis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.96.47.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417040386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TarahNov2015","Id":281254,"Name":"TarahNov2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.19.50.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60faa641acd6902cb16d5bb4bd6f1ce3","RawContent":"I&#039;m booked there in October! I&#039;ve been trying to find photos of actual weddings that have happened there so far and stumbled upon this website. Anyone find any so far? :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1881487,"PostDate":1420181517,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm booked there in October! I've been trying to find photos of actual weddings that have happened there so far and stumbled upon this website. Anyone find any so far? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clcstrand@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.19.50.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420181424,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"DFWchels","Id":281553,"Name":"DFWchels","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.254.215.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9eddee968748cd8b98b60dfdbe840fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ginnyc\"] I am getting married here on April 17! &amp;nbsp;When are you traveling? &amp;nbsp;How has your wedding planning experience been? &amp;nbsp;We are having issues with the florist and photographer so that has been frustrating for me. &amp;nbsp;Have you had problems? &amp;nbsp;Are you having a bigger wedding or small? &amp;nbsp;We traveled to the resort to check things out back in December and were impressed overall, though I will say that the indoor option (\"ballroom\") is terrible!! &amp;nbsp;You will literally be married in a dark hallway with no windows, etc. &amp;nbsp;So we are praying for nice weather\u2026 &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887652,"PostDate":1424995802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278720-ginnyc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ginnyc<\/span><\/a> I am getting married here on April 17! \u00a0When are you traveling? \u00a0How has your wedding planning experience been? \u00a0We are having issues with the florist and photographer so that has been frustrating for me. \u00a0Have you had problems? \u00a0Are you having a bigger wedding or small? \u00a0We traveled to the resort to check things out back in December and were impressed overall, though I will say that the indoor option (\"ballroom\") is terrible!! \u00a0You will literally be married in a dark hallway with no windows, etc. \u00a0So we are praying for nice weather\u2026 \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"charysse.johnston@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.254.215.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424995431,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beachgirl228","Id":282262,"Name":"beachgirl228","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.126.115.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"644569a5b373d03149466ebb0f9c8ec5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! I am new to this site, but so far I love all the info! I am attempting to schedule my wedding here at Secrets Playa Mujeres for April 2016, however have been VERY frustrated with their delay in replying to emails regarding booking the date. I am even using a travel agent and we have been unable to get anywhere for several weeks! Any suggestions or tips on dealing with them??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900133,"PostDate":1436491004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! I am new to this site, but so far I love all the info! I am attempting to schedule my wedding here at Secrets Playa Mujeres for April 2016, however have been VERY frustrated with their delay in replying to emails regarding booking the date. I am even using a travel agent and we have been unable to get anywhere for several weeks! Any suggestions or tips on dealing with them??<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcurtis105@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.126.115.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436490757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283892.jpg?_r=1436625696","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hcurtis","Id":283892,"Name":"hcurtis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.49.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36eece5e7edc063977fd5c1c23503485","RawContent":"Hi \n\nFrom what I understand there is a issue with staffing in the wedding department at the resort. Who are you in contact with? \n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:weddings1.secpm@secretsresorts.com&#039;&gt;weddings1.secpm@secretsresorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is the email I have used.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900135,"PostDate":1436492295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi <br>\nFrom what I understand there is a issue with staffing in the wedding department at the resort. Who are you in contact with? <br \/><p><a href='mailto:weddings1.secpm@secretsresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>weddings1.secpm@secretsresorts.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is the email I have used.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megwade@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401238846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278140.jpg?_r=1401242002","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megwade","Id":278140,"Name":"megwade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.80.32","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a51878e51cdd32b55cf0c822ce234606","RawContent":"I have gotten one response only from the email weddings.secpm@secretsresorts.com so maybe I&#039;ll shoot them an email at the one you have. \n\nShould I be worried about the staffing issues? Do you think it will affect my overall wedding? \n\nMy fianc\u00e9 is really excited about this resort, but I don&#039;t want to be stressed during the entire planning experience if they can&#039;t get it together.","Attachments":[],"Id":1900171,"PostDate":1436548932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have gotten one response only from the email weddings.secpm@secretsresorts.com so maybe I'll shoot them an email at the one you have. <br>\nShould I be worried about the staffing issues? Do you think it will affect my overall wedding? <br>\nMy fianc\u00e9 is really excited about this resort, but I don't want to be stressed during the entire planning experience if they can't get it together. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcurtis105@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.126.115.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436490757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283892.jpg?_r=1436625696","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hcurtis","Id":283892,"Name":"hcurtis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.75.49.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"324542d2e3064dc9c3b5751e69aa0e6d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;They really do not start getting the ball rolling until 3 months out.&amp;nbsp; That is when things started to fall into place.&amp;nbsp; They do so many weddings that they cannot give priority so early from what I understand.&amp;nbsp; Trust me I know this is a frustrating process and I was a mess with not knowing.&amp;nbsp; But keep in mind it does all work out.&amp;nbsp; They really do know what they are doing.&amp;nbsp; When you get there as well they show you options etc and you can change prety much everything and anything if you do not like it.&amp;nbsp; I do know they have a new coordinator named Alejandra so I am sure she will contact you soon.&amp;nbsp; I have had to email for something forgotten there, and she responded from the spmweddings email within 24 hours.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900181,"PostDate":1436555871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>They really do not start getting the ball rolling until 3 months out.\u00a0 That is when things started to fall into place.\u00a0 They do so many weddings that they cannot give priority so early from what I understand.\u00a0 Trust me I know this is a frustrating process and I was a mess with not knowing.\u00a0 But keep in mind it does all work out.\u00a0 They really do know what they are doing.\u00a0 When you get there as well they show you options etc and you can change prety much everything and anything if you do not like it.\u00a0 I do know they have a new coordinator named Alejandra so I am sure she will contact you soon.\u00a0 I have had to email for something forgotten there, and she responded from the spmweddings email within 24 hours.<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megwade@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"198.53.98.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1401238846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278140.jpg?_r=1401242002","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megwade","Id":278140,"Name":"megwade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.243.10.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77406,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb398bddf459be29858678748534a78f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I finally got in contact with them and my date is booked! Our communication has really improved, so I am significantly less stressed now!!! Thanks for your help! Any more information you or any other brides have on weddings at this resort would be SO helpful!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900610,"PostDate":1437091139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I finally got in contact with them and my date is booked! Our communication has really improved, so I am significantly less stressed now!!! Thanks for your help! Any more information you or any other brides have on weddings at this resort would be SO helpful!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcurtis105@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.126.115.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436490757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283892.jpg?_r=1436625696","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hcurtis","Id":283892,"Name":"hcurtis","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":29,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
