' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Yucatan Playacar Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513371119_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...and from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153338826264487.1073741931.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Secrets Maroma Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1512090_10153338830379487_2459881000892973590_o.jpg\" alt=\"1512090_10153338830379487_24598810008929\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and smooth sailing with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/471572_10150957704624487_1950324022_o.jpg\" alt=\"471572_10150957704624487_1950324022_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\