>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac781b0a2874c4f378ed3923cf3e2660","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks. We were thinking of getting them just for our wedding party since they are the only ones i&#039;m making OOT bags for. I&#039;ll have to see how much my FI was blanning to spend on these.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For wedding favors we were thinking of doing flip flop bottle openers and then somehow writing on them&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;\"Janelle &amp;amp; Kyle&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Mexico 2016 &lt;\/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;\"&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.flipflopbottleopener.com\/images\/flip-flop-bottle-opener-01.jpg\" alt=\"flip-flop-bottle-opener-01.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897930,"PostDate":1433434419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/he