t favors for a beach wedding.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All your guest will love them!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/es\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...allarta.com\/es\/<\/a><\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81350-favorscaletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_67802.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='FavorsCaletas'  width='200' height='200'  alt='FavorsCaletas' id='sml_image_view_81350' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dclodge, on 15 May 2014 - 07:43 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are at a stand still on what to do for wedding reception party favors. What are some super original and creative ideas?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.178.97.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a972a202f40bdecdfb49fe0c6bbaba77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello @&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" h