{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":136,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1902172,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284335,"Name":"Devinprice","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1439093678,"LastPoster":{"Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1902228,"PostDate":1439233092,"PostContent":"Congrats! It isn't on your list but I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites 2 months ago and...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.8.9.141","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"004bb0863eb74f7b0311e32888989b94","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello, I&#039;m new to the group. My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning a&amp;nbsp;destination wedding, newly engaged :) I wanted to know if there are any stellar resorts\/all-inclusive that anyone can recommend? We are planning to look at Sandals Royal Carribbean, Secrets Wild Orchid, and RIU.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902172,"PostDate":1439093678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello, I'm new to the group. My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning a\u00a0destination wedding, newly engaged <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I wanted to know if there are any stellar resorts\/all-inclusive that anyone can recommend? We are planning to look at Sandals Royal Carribbean, Secrets Wild Orchid, and RIU.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"devinmprice@gmail.com","IpAddress":"100.8.9.141","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1439092928,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Devinprice","Id":284335,"Name":"Devinprice","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.150.69.53","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":true,"PostKey":"c65a39f52dee9f6be41ebe2847c0f2ab","RawContent":"Secrets is absolutely beautiful. We went 2 years ago for vacation . I can&#039;t imagine a wedding here being anything less than perfect!! Best of luck to u!congrats!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1902173,"PostDate":1439093949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Secrets is absolutely beautiful. We went 2 years ago for vacation . I can't imagine a wedding here being anything less than perfect!! Best of luck to u!congrats!<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902173]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284060-14390901845.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439090183.616280.jpg - Size: 303.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284060-14390901845.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439090183.616280.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902173]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284060-14390902506.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439090249.815878.jpg - Size: 303.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-284060-14390902506.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1439090249.815878.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrisleotta126@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"73.150.69.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437484439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Chris126","Id":284060,"Name":"Chris126","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.251","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64921caa6fb519220ba56d17001ddc3a","RawContent":"Congrats and welcome! You&#039;re definitely looking at 3 beautiful resorts! I&#039;m not sure about the Sandals but there are definitely threads here for the other two. If you do a search up top you&#039;ll get multiple threads. I know we had one bride that recently got married at one of the RIU resorts in Jamaica so I know if you do a search the conversations will come up for you to read.\n\n\nWould also recommend a good travel agent. They&#039;re the experts on possible perks you might be entitled to with your group and they&#039;ll also assist with what&#039;s available depending on the size of your group. They&#039;ll free you up too to handle your wedding planning so that your guests can deal directly with the agent for questions and booking.\n\n\nIf you&#039;re in the US the owners of this site are DW experts and can be reached through the link on this site.\n\n\nGood luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1902178,"PostDate":1439136747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats and welcome! You're definitely looking at 3 beautiful resorts! I'm not sure about the Sandals but there are definitely threads here for the other two. If you do a search up top you'll get multiple threads. I know we had one bride that recently got married at one of the RIU resorts in Jamaica so I know if you do a search the conversations will come up for you to read.<br><br>\nWould also recommend a good travel agent. They're the experts on possible perks you might be entitled to with your group and they'll also assist with what's available depending on the size of your group. They'll free you up too to handle your wedding planning so that your guests can deal directly with the agent for questions and booking.<br><br>\nIf you're in the US the owners of this site are DW experts and can be reached through the link on this site.<br><br>\nGood luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.143.225.53","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Yesterday, 10:11 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1439143882,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"791d2798aa2f5c0c88cf3255317383db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum, Devinprice and Congrats on your upcoming Jamaican wedding!!! you&#039;ve come to a great place for lots of ideas, info, advice + support from everyone here, so well done on an excellent start :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....here are some magical beach wedding moments that matter captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera for further inspiration....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10466993_10152470886239487_2370077874343987137_o.jpg\" alt=\"10466993_10152470886239487_2370077874343\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10428182_10152562437969487_962117043379211812_o.jpg\" alt=\"10428182_10152562437969487_9621170433792\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1403737_10151972431249487_140646511_o.jpg\" alt=\"1403737_10151972431249487_140646511_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....or these from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153360211499487.1073741932.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;RUI Yucatan Playacar Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513371119_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11270656_10153360215024487_3453967084088728324_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270656_10153360215024487_3453967084088\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902184,"PostDate":1439143644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum, Devinprice and Congrats on your upcoming Jamaican wedding!!! you've come to a great place for lots of ideas, info, advice + support from everyone here, so well done on an excellent start <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....here are some magical beach wedding moments that matter captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera for further inspiration....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10466993_10152470886239487_2370077874343987137_o.jpg\" alt=\"10466993_10152470886239487_2370077874343\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10428182_10152562437969487_962117043379211812_o.jpg\" alt=\"10428182_10152562437969487_9621170433792\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/1403737_10151972431249487_140646511_o.jpg\" alt=\"1403737_10151972431249487_140646511_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....or these from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153360211499487.1073741932.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Yucatan Playacar Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513371119_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270681_10153360213654487_6883145239513\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11270656_10153360215024487_3453967084088728324_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270656_10153360215024487_3453967084088\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.249.52.69","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9de15d410ca124db997312650f73d17a","RawContent":"Congratulations I went to Secrets a few years ago fell in love with it and am getting married there July 2016! I highly recommend there it is a beautiful resort!","Attachments":[],"Id":1902194,"PostDate":1439171249,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations I went to Secrets a few years ago fell in love with it and am getting married there July 2016! I highly recommend there it is a beautiful resort! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolechin4@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.87.42.110","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407440509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JamaicaNicole","Id":279353,"Name":"JamaicaNicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.249.82.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f17c31e125cfb2fa9666d213bac9c75","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JamaicaNicole\" post=\"1902194\" timestamp=\"1439167649\"]\nCongratulations I went to Secrets a few years ago fell in love with it and am getting married there July 2016! I highly recommend there it is a beautiful resort![\/quote]\nHi JamaicaNicole, thanks for share. Can you post some pic or tell something about it?","Attachments":[],"Id":1902195,"PostDate":1439173363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JamaicaNicole, on Yesterday, 05:47 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congratulations I went to Secrets a few years ago fell in love with it and am getting married there July 2016! I highly recommend there it is a beautiful resort!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi JamaicaNicole, thanks for share. Can you post some pic or tell something about it?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Duongquan<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.review24hour.com\">http:\/\/www.review24hour.com<\/a><br><br>\nReview Books Download : Weight Loss, Fitness, Workout, Remedies, Diabetes, Nutrition, Women's Health, Men's Health program. Make your life better!","Email":"duongtanbaoquan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.249.82.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437877471,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284133.jpg?_r=1439222866","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Duongquan","Id":284133,"Name":"Duongquan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79477,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2434c3ab69c908a96e96d78f21b56f59","RawContent":"Congrats! It isn&#039;t on your list but I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites 2 months ago and it was fantastic. We needed a resort that was family-friendly and it fit what we wanted for our wedding and also what worked for our guests and their budgets. Originally we did not want to be in Montego Bay but the proximity to the airport was really nice for our guests who were staying 4 nights - they didn&#039;t waste a bunch of time on travel. If you have specific questions about IRHS I&#039;m happy to answer!\n\n[quote name=\"Devinprice\" post=\"1902172\" timestamp=\"1439090078\"]\nHello, I&#039;m new to the group. My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning a destination wedding, newly engaged :) I wanted to know if there are any stellar resorts\/all-inclusive that anyone can recommend? We are planning to look at Sandals Royal Carribbean, Secrets Wild Orchid, and RIU.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1902228,"PostDate":1439233092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! It isn't on your list but I got married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites 2 months ago and it was fantastic. We needed a resort that was family-friendly and it fit what we wanted for our wedding and also what worked for our guests and their budgets. Originally we did not want to be in Montego Bay but the proximity to the airport was really nice for our guests who were staying 4 nights - they didn't waste a bunch of time on travel. If you have specific questions about IRHS I'm happy to answer!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Devinprice, on 08 August 2015 - 08:14 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello, I'm new to the group. My fianc\u00e9 and I are planning a\u00a0destination wedding, newly engaged <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I wanted to know if there are any stellar resorts\/all-inclusive that anyone can recommend? We are planning to look at Sandals Royal Carribbean, Secrets Wild Orchid, and RIU.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79477","Title":"Jamaica Weddings","LastPostDate":1439233092},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
