68-karisma-wedding-webinar-febuary-22-2014-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;March 1, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; Hyatt Zilara &amp;amp; Gran Caribe &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76171-hyatt-zilara-gran-caribe-wedding-webinar-sat-march-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;March 8, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST   Moon Palace &amp;amp; Playacar Palce &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76228-moon-palace-playacar-palace-wedding-webinar-march-8-2014\/&#039;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;March 15, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST   The ROYAL PDC &amp;amp; Gran Porto &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76172-royal-pdc-gran-porto-wedding-webinar-march-15-2014-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;March 22, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;NOW Jade &amp;amp; NOW Sapphire &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76429-now-jade-now-sapphire-wedding-webinar-3222014-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;March 29, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Dreams Riviera Cancun &amp;amp; Aventuras &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76430-dreams-riviera-cancun-puerto-aventuras-wedding-webinar-32914\/&#039;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;April 5, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;NOW Amber &amp;amp; Secrets Vallarta Bay &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76431-now-amber-secrets-vallarta-bay-wedding-webinar-452014-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;April 12, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Le Blanc &amp;amp; Beach Palace &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76229-le-blanc-beach-palace-wedding-webinar-april-12-2014\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;April 26, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Hard Rock All-Inclusive Collection &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76778-hard-rock-wedding-webinar-sat-april-26-2014-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;May 10, 2014 | Saturday &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 9:00am PST &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Iberostar Resorts &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76779-iberostar-resorts-wedding-webinar-sat-may-10-2014-900-am-pst\/&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;Link to webinar INFO&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;====================================================&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;These&amp;nbsp;webinars&amp;nbsp;are a great way to meet your resort wedding team and get answers for your wedding and travel questions.&lt;\/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;I will post individual threads for each webinar as we get closer so we can get a list of questions we want answered together.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1820811,"PostDate":1388263399,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(253,252,250);color:rgb(97,95,90);font-size:17px\">We are planning our 2014 webinar schedule. \u00a0If you are interested in attending, please subscribe to this thread as we will update when we finalize the different resorts<\/span><strong>\u00a0<\/strong><span  style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(253,252,250);color:rgb(97,95,90);font-size:17px\">and also update with links, more information, resort amenities.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/43\/439182ce_webinar_image.jpeg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"336\" src=\"http:\/\/cdn.bestdestinationwedding.com\/4\/43\/600x336px-LL-439182ce_webinar_image.jpeg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"600x336px-LL-439182ce_webinar_image.jpeg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Spring 2014 Wedding Webinar Schedule<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Date \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u0