I was thinking when I said \"basket cut\" - I'm pretty sure I made that up! This one is way too wide though - 11 mm.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clb26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"67.182.138.230","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1148516640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"A10CalGal","Id":206736,"Name":"A10CalGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53f571bcac4693f6a5235dc255508da9","RawContent":"Natalie - this is what I was thinking when I made the suggestion about looking for a thinner band w\/pave set stones...it&#039;s 2.3mm wide\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.e-weddingbands.com\/store\/media\/newdiamond\/0090-b.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":5414,"PostDate":1162449225,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Natalie - this is what I was thinking when I made the suggestion about looking for a thinner band w\/pave set stones...it's 2.3mm wide<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.e-weddingbands.com\/store\/media\/